{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>專案管理總是讓你頭疼嗎？《Gantt Planner》這款高效能的專案管理 App 今天限時免費中，它專為追求成果而非雜亂的使用者設計，無論你是新創企業家、自由工作者，還是開發者與設計師，都能透過它將複雜專案轉化為清晰易懂的視覺化時程，輕鬆掌握進度，提升工作效率。</p>\n\n<h2>視覺化甘特圖</h2>\n<p>《Gantt Planner》主打直觀的視覺化甘特圖，能將複雜專案化為清晰易懂的時程，並提供簡化任務追蹤功能，助您輕鬆管理截止日期與進度。應用輕量無需登入，支援離線使用，讓專案執行更專注、更有效率。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-184-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-185-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-186-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-187-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-25-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-26-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Gantt Planner: Task &amp; Timeline</li>\n<li>應用類別：Business</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T18:18:13.836889+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}